msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Please, I can't accept your offer! I'll return the million\r\n"
"yen I won, too, just please, let me go in peace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Returning your reward money would be a lot of trouble!\r\n"
"Please, just consider the publishing offer one more time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"I just can't do it... I don't have time to be working on\r\n"
"manga right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Are you worried about your parents? I can convince them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"You can't convince my father, it's impossible! He'll say no,\r\n"
"no matter what you say or offer him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Well, why did you enter the contest, then!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I know you want to draw manga, Hirano-san! And I know in\r\n"
"my heart that whatever you create will be a smash hit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"As your editor, I will do all that I can to support you and\r\n"
"the series you create, Hirano-san. Let's work hard,\r\n"
"together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"I still can't accept your offer! Just pretend that this\r\n"
"never even happened! Goodbye!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Oh... You're the man from earlier..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "What were you two arguing about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I've gotta go!"
msgstr ""

